From 00000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yocto Integration <yocto@example.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Aug 2024 13:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix seccomp configuration for Yocto builds

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]

Ensures seccomp is properly configured for Yocto build environment.

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index a374cc09..b6632580 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@
 WITH_NVCGO   ?= yes
 WITH_LIBELF  ?= no
 WITH_TIRPC   ?= no
-WITH_SECCOMP ?= yes
+WITH_SECCOMP := yes
 
 ##### Global definitions #####
 
